  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">豪華別墅</span></em></strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>《豪華別墅》是一款生存地圖，內含數座功能齊全且裝飾精美的別墅。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>地圖位於交通便利的環境中，專為多人遊戲設計，並配備了多名玩家生存所需的資源。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>內部裝潢講究細節，為每棟房屋營造出獨特的氛圍。</span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span>地圖預覽：</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9be44a5d-cd7c-4674-b33a-06ef09f4ab8a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e8960571-3eee-429c-816c-22d1c44dd25a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_277197aa-6c1b-4f0f-892e-805ac375fb96.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_797b19e9-a04d-4e26-9705-6255485e7558.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_34329600-6670-40e3-9b89-15269657a368.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8d45dc5b-d23c-41bd-a8ed-d72ec29ad7b0.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_08f946ea-ed94-45a7-b77f-df4ea3ccde0a.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a9884fe6-4355-43ce-967f-1aa4d08d31d0.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c4ef3fae-8b0f-44d5-a4f6-40aba32d7c29.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5c21b3c5-86ec-4388-92c3-d7acffba2048.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d4736569-7d26-4265-98ba-09d77b9fa40e.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>除了宏偉的別墅外，您還將發現一座大型花園、一艘豪華遊艇、一片小型農耕區，以及幾棟極簡風格的小木屋，可作為住所或小型儲物空間使用。</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">冒險就此展開！</span></h3>",
